# Box art drive for the landing-page games carousel (site/demos/box-art.mjs).
# Enter leaves the menu, then the ship flies wave 1: held rotate + thrust
# (levels, so down/up brackets the hold) with Space fired every 15 frames.
# The captured window (frames 150-266) is mid-wave, rocks already splitting.
#
#   functor -d examples/asteroids run native --input-script boxart.script \
#     --script-dt 0.0166667 --capture-at-frame 150 --capture-frame /tmp/ast.png

